  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2021 Canberra PNGRWH Papua N.Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help the pregnant mothers during their last trimester of pregnancy wait and prepare for the birth in the identified marginalised communities in the region as identified and targeted by the previous program visits under, Health Training, Awareness and Education program.It is identified during the past Health Training, Awareness and Training programs that in all the rural communities, mothers have difficulties in access to the nearest health facility due to the geographical locations of the communities to the health facilities. Therefore, safe birthing is not possible, resulting in developing health problems both by the mother and her new born baby.</narrative>
  </description>
